title V4 - Hybrid retrieval with reranking
direction right
colorMode bold
styleMode shadow

Postgres [color: blue] {
  HNSW vector index [shape: cylinder, icon: database]
  Full-text GIN index [shape: cylinder, icon: database]
  Chunk table [shape: cylinder, icon: database]
}

Retrieve [color: blue] {
  Standalone question [icon: help-circle]
  Vector search top 30 [icon: search]
  Keyword search top 30 [icon: type]
  RRF fusion [icon: git-merge]
  Reranker jina-turbo [icon: bar-chart-2]
  Reranker gate [shape: diamond, icon: filter, color: orange]
  Add neighbouring chunks [icon: layers]
}

Downstream [color: green] {
  Evidence selection and verified answer [icon: shield]
}

Refusal [icon: x-octagon, color: red]

Standalone question > Vector search top 30
Standalone question > Keyword search top 30
Vector search top 30 <> HNSW vector index
Keyword search top 30 <> Full-text GIN index
Vector search top 30 > RRF fusion
Keyword search top 30 > RRF fusion
RRF fusion > Reranker jina-turbo: 24 candidates
Reranker jina-turbo > Reranker gate: top 6
Reranker gate > Refusal: low relevance
Reranker gate > Add neighbouring chunks
Add neighbouring chunks <> Chunk table
Add neighbouring chunks > Evidence selection and verified answer: same as V3
